The destruction caused by the Ancient Weapon, fired by Greedy, let Midranda invade the continent and seize Pillai. After a long battle, he was defeated. But at the last instant something interfered with Idhas's magic, saving Midranda from eternal banishment.
That interference tore the dimensional fabric.
Greedy confessed that Midranda was saved by his ally from the water people.

Dimensional rifts began to open everywhere.
Mages and Shamans were sent to close them.

[Challenge Objective]

Talk to the Royal Shaman on the Road to the Wind.
